00:15:14.373 --> 00:15:15.499
I believe in you.

00:15:15.499 --> 00:15:17.490
I hope you continue to believe in yourself

00:15:17.490 --> 00:15:19.522
and whatever your one word is.

00:15:19.522 --> 00:15:20.612
Much love.

00:15:20.612 --> 00:15:22.112
I'll see you soon.

